OL,3,GNEWSASydney Sweeney wing-walks on plane
OL,4,Aabove Ashford
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS actress Sydney Sweeney has taken her
OL,7,Fcareer to new heights by strapping
OL,8,Fherself to the top of a plane and
OL,9,Fflying over the Kent countryside.
OL,11,FThe Euphoria star carried out the
OL,12,Fwing-walking stunt on a biplane which
OL,13,Ftook off outside the village of
OL,14,FHeadcorn, near Ashford, last week.
OL,16,FPosting a video of the daring feat on
OL,17,Fsocial media on Monday, the 28-year-old
OL,18,Falso told Tom Cruise to "watch out" -
OL,19,Fthe Hollywood action man having
OL,20,Fperformed similar aerial acrobatics in
OL,21,Fthe 2025 movie Mission: Impossible -
OL,22,FThe Final Reckoning.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
