OL,3,GNEWSASydney Sweeney wing-walks on plane
OL,4,Aabove Ashford
OL,5,
OL,6,FMichael Pickin, director and pilot at
OL,7,FHeadcorn Aerodrome-based The Wing Walk
OL,8,FCompany, described Sweeney as having
OL,9,Fbeen "a bit apprehensive at first",
OL,10,Fbut, ultimately, "an adrenaline junkie
OL,11,Fat heart".
